+## Factored object-relational executable transition model
+
+**Sources:** FIOC-WM, arXiv:2511.02225; SOLD, arXiv:2410.08822; FOCUS,
+arXiv:2307.02427.
+
+**Mapping to current stack:** convert A1's connected components, relation
